      "summary": "Largest Heroicons category module for the docs site: 165 auto-generated SolidJS icon components (24x24 outline style) spanning UI glyphs from academic-cap to x-mark, plus hand-authored opencode-specific icons (IconLetter, IconMultiSelect, IconSettings, IconSingleSelect) appended at the end.",
