      "summary": "Side-by-side diff renderer for the share view: parses unified patches via the workspace @opencode-ai/diff-wasm package, pairs consecutive removals with additions into modified/added/removed rows for the desktop two-column layout, and regroups them into stacked blocks for mobile, highlighting each line through ContentCode.",
