      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Removals and additions are paired index-by-index so a line replacement renders as a single two-column row instead of separate minus/plus rows — a deliberate deviation from raw unified-diff layout, with a look-ahead loop over hunk lines."
    },
